79," Tropical Cyclone Pam has wreaked devastation in Vanuatu, causing unbelievable destruction and massive humanitarian needs. The storm has weakened some but is still pounding the islands with strong winds and torrential rain. The capital, Port Vila, has seen significant damage, with many people losing their homes and shelter, food and water being urgent priorities.",1006.3312638392672,37.2402223270147,4.7993549555540085,958.0159275378101,0.025563452010294856,1862,35615,0.2861220885693579,0.9622511399227618
